        <mxCell id="sa-vEfJ3S5XPAa1rJgTy-68" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=10;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;🔴 Heart rate &lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;100 bpm&lt;/b&gt; despite initial steps&lt;br&gt;🔴 Apnea, gasping, or &lt;b&gt;labored breathing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔴 &lt;b&gt;Persistent cyanosis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔴 &lt;b&gt;Preterm (&amp;lt;37 weeks, especially &amp;lt;34 weeks)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔴 Requiring &lt;b&gt;positive pressure ventilation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔴 Requiring &lt;b&gt;chest compressions or medications&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔴 &lt;b&gt;Congenital anomalies&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
